00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:58.240
atensi difusi menurunkan

00:09:58.240 --> 00:09:59.520
waktu jam dinding secara terukur.

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:01.300
Penelitian secara konsisten

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:02.580
menunjukkan percepatan 2X

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:03.120
