Penggabungan token TOME

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:10.860
bertumpuk

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:11.900
dengan keuntungan ini.

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:13.880
Tanpa kenal gabungan,

00:10:14.060 --> 00:10:14.900
manfaatnya terhambat oleh

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:15.480
bandwidth memori

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:16.060
dan tata letak

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:17.060
yang tidak dioptimalkan.

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:18.600
Senjangan semakin membesar

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:20.060
pada 1024 x 1024

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:21.320
dan konkurrensi yang lebih tinggi.

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:22.820
Untuk mengacak artefak,

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:23.420
mulailah dengan

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:24.340
enumerasi kapabilitas.

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:25.560
Saat startup,

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:26.680
cetak daftar penyedia yang tepat

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:28.040
dan fitur yang dilaporkan.

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:29.720
Versi Tensor RT,

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:30.900
ketersediaan FP16

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:31.740
dan INT8,

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:33.280
ruang kerja maksimum,

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:35.160
heuristik konvolusi CU DNN,

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:35.660
kehadiran,

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:37.380
NCCL untuk multi-JPU.

