00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:44.960
verifikasi mana yang sebenarnya

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:46.120
terikat pada node graph Anda.

00:10:46.760 --> 00:10:47.960
Catat apakah node attention

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:49.400
ditetapkan ke tensor RT

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:50.480
dengan kernel gabungan

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:51.660
atau ke kernel CUDA generik.

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:53.140
Selanjutnya,

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:53.840
periksa lingkungan.

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:55.020
Query driver tersebut.

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:56.520
NVIDIA SME menunjukkan

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:57.100
modul kernel

00:10:57.100 --> 00:10:58.160
