pustaka CUDA 12 di 3

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:06.840
tetapi driver host

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:08.260
hanya mendukung hingga 12 di 3,

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:09.820
mode kompatibilitas runtime

00:11:09.820 --> 00:11:10.980
mungkin dimuat dengan batasan.

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:12.500
Jika image mengharapkan

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:14.000
header tensor RT 8.6

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:14.720
tetapi plug-in node

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:15.800
menyediakan 8.4,

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:17.100
panggilan API akan menurun

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:18.720
