00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:19.620
Remediasinya adalah

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:20.140
matrix build,

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:20.800
bukan sekadar harap.

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:22.160
Sematkan versi yang tepat

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:23.100
dalam satu sumber kebenaran.

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:24.680
Image dasar

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:25.940
dengan kompatibilitas driver,

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:26.900
CUDA minor,

