CUDA NN,

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:28.860
has build ORT,

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:30.220
dan versi tensor RT.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:31.700
Buat image inferensi

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:32.740
berdasarkan matrix tersebut

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:33.860
dan tolak node yang tidak cocok

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:34.700
melalui label node

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:35.560
dan pemeriksaan penerimaan.

00:11:36.140 --> 00:11:37.140
Prabangun dan catch engine

00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:37.680
tensor RT

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:38.700
untuk setiap varian model

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:40.120
dan resolusi pada versi tensor RT

00:11:40.120 --> 00:11:41.120
yang tepat yang Anda terapkan.

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:42.760
Perlakukan file rencana

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:44.160
sebagai artefak yang terikat pada matrix.

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:45.600
Jangan pernah mengandalkan

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:46.220
pembuatan engine

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:47.020
di node saat produksi.

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:48.380
Hal itu menutupi penyimpangan

00:11:48.380 --> 00:11:49.380
dan memperlambat call start.

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:51.120
Agar tetap konsisten,

00:11:51.340 --> 00:11:52.180
tambahkan uji smoke CE

00:11:52.180 --> 00:11:53.460
yang memastikan kapabilitas kernel.

00:11:54.260 --> 00:11:55.580
Jalankan container di runner

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:56.860
terisolasi dengan driver target

00:11:56.860 --> 00:11:57.580
dan verifikasi.

