Tensor RT membuat kernel FP16

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:00.320
yang digunakan.

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:01.880
Node attention digabungkan.

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:02.880
Binding IO aktif,

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:04.600
exformers atau SDP diakui.

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:07.160
Jalankan set prompt deterministic

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:08.240
dan gadalkan build

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:09.220
jika latensi melebihi

00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:09.880
