00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:11.280
atau jika log berisi

00:12:11.280 --> 00:12:12.380
bahasa fallback apapun.

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:15.000
Simpan snapshot kapabilitas

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.000
