00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:36.860
tasa efisiensi dari dalam.

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:39.620
Bukti menunjukkan kebocoran perlahan,

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:40.440
image membengkak,

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:41.520
