00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:01.520
akan berperilaku tidak semestinya.

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:02.980
Jika arena memori

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:03.740
menambung alokasi,

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:04.900
Ramchon akan memicu paging

00:13:04.900 --> 00:13:05.620
