00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:33.060
Buktinya tidak misterius.

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:33.800
Docker history

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:34.520
menceritakan kisahnya

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:35.120
